## Troubleshooting

| Issue | Cause | Fix |
|-------|-------|-----|
| Invalid ID / Update failed | No matching Title in SharePoint | Condition 3 should check `length > 0` |
| Empty row errors | CSV has blank rows | Condition 1/2 filters these |
| Data not enriching | Identifier mismatch | Check for exact match, extra spaces |

